'''BAKS Esports''' ''(formerly stylized as '''BakS eSports''')'' is a [[:Category:Russia|Russian]] esports organization founded by Russian football player [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Soltmurad_Bakayev Soltmurad Bakaev].

